Q: Programmatically get ListItemVersion using client object model SharePoint 2010 A: <p>you can get older version file like this</p>

<pre><code>string versionItemUrl = file.ServerRelativeUrl.Replace(Path.GetFileName(file.ServerRelativeUrl),"") + _version.Url;<br />File oldFile = web.GetFileByServerRelativeUrl(versionItemUrl);
clientContext.Load(oldFile, f=>f.ListItemAllFields);<br />clientContext.ExecuteQuery();<br /></code></pre>
